1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:02,168
Outreach gets messy
fast.

2
00:00:02,222 --> 00:00:03,495
Who did I message?

3
00:00:03,534 --> 00:00:04,595
What did I say?

4
00:00:04,628 --> 00:00:06,608
Who needs a follow-up
today?

5
00:00:06,669 --> 00:00:09,002
If the answer lives in
your head,

6
00:00:09,074 --> 00:00:10,205
you will forget.

7
00:00:10,240 --> 00:00:13,139
So I'm building the tool
that answers it.

8
00:00:13,229 --> 00:00:14,926
This is my Today screen.

9
00:00:14,978 --> 00:00:16,039
Follow-ups due.

10
00:00:16,072 --> 00:00:16,920
Who replied.

11
00:00:16,947 --> 00:00:18,078
What to do next.

12
00:00:18,113 --> 00:00:21,153
Every business has a
stage in the pipeline,

13
00:00:21,247 --> 00:00:23,934
and a full history I can
step through,

14
00:00:24,017 --> 00:00:25,078
event by event.

15
00:00:25,111 --> 00:00:27,373
It doesn't send anything
for me,

16
00:00:27,443 --> 00:00:28,928
and it doesn't guess.

17
00:00:28,974 --> 00:00:32,580
It records what I do, and
shows me what I recorded.

18
00:00:32,691 --> 00:00:35,449
I'm building it around
my own outreach,

19
00:00:35,534 --> 00:00:37,655
and I'll tell you if it
works.

20
00:00:37,721 --> 00:00:38,711
Andrew Builds.

